# chiaki-ng Wii U — English language pack (gui-107)
# Copy next to config.ini:  sd:/wiiu/apps/chiaki/eng.pak
#
# Format (UTF-8, one entry per line):
#   @lang=English          display name of the language (first line)
#   # comment              ignored
#   Spanish source=Translation
#
# The key is the exact Spanish literal from the code; a missing key
# falls back to the source text. If a KEY contains '=' write it as
# '==' (the parser splits on the first unpaired '='). Values may use
# '=' normally. %s / %d / %.24s placeholders must be kept.
@lang=English

# --- session / cards ---
Última sesión: detenida=Last session: stopped
Última sesión fallida: %s — %s=Last session failed: %s — %s
Última sesión fallida: %s=Last session failed: %s
Conectando con %s%s=Connecting to %s%s
la consola=the console
para cancelar=to cancel
Modo mando activo=Controller mode active
El video esta en tu consola=The video is on your console
Sin video: solo audio y mando=No video: audio and controller only
Sin vídeo/audio=No video/audio
Sin vídeo=No video
Normal=Normal

# --- toolbar / console list / footer ---
PIN (↑)=PIN (↑)
ID=ID
IP=IP
Buscar=Search
Consola detectada - pulsa ↑ para registrar=Console detected - press ↑ to register
Sin consolas registradas - pulsa ↑ con el PIN de la PS4=No registered consoles - press ↑ with the PS4 PIN
Buscando consolas en la red...=Searching for consoles on the network...
Dirección: %s=Address: %s
Estado: -=State: -
Estado: registrando...=State: registering...
Estado: sin discovery (Y==buscar)=State: no discovery (Y=search)
Estado: lista=State: ready
Estado: en espera=State: standby
Estado: discovery=State: discovering
Despertar=Wake up
Conectar=Connect
Registrando... introduce el PIN que muestra la PS4=Registering... enter the PIN shown on the PS4
↑: registrar con el PIN de la PS4=↑: register with the PS4 PIN
←/→: elegir consola=←/→: select console

# --- delete dialog ---
No se pudo eliminar la consola=Could not delete the console
Consola eliminada: %s=Console deleted: %s
Sin consolas registradas - pulsa ↑ con el PIN=No registered consoles - press ↑ with the PIN
¿Eliminar consola?=Delete console?
Se eliminará '%.24s' de la lista.='%.24s' will be removed from the list.
Dirección: %.32s=Address: %.32s
volver=back
Eliminar=Delete

